\mathrm{ZfcPosetBooleanAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (explicit Boolean-algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"44ab18b3631aa4ec\" href=\"?note=44ab18b3631aa4ec\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-poset-boolean-algebra.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-poset-boolean-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}ultrafilter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBooleanUltrafilter}_S(U,B,\\leq_B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBooleanAlgebra}_S(B,\\leq_B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\n\\land U\\subseteq B\\land1_B\\in U\\land0_B\\notin U\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b\\in U\\;(a\\wedge_Bb\\in U)\n\\land\\forall a\\in U\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;(a\\wedge_Bb=a\\to b\\in U)\n\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;(b\\in U\\lor\\neg_Bb\\in U).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}ultrafilter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBooleanUltrafilter}_S(U,B,\\leq_B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBooleanAlgebra}_S(B,\\leq_B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\n\\land U\\subseteq B\\land1_B\\in U\\land0_B\\notin U\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b\\in U\\;(a\\wedge_Bb\\in U)\n\\land\\forall a\\in U\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;(a\\wedge_Bb=a\\to b\\in U)\n\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;(b\\in U\\lor\\neg_Bb\\in U).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>All Boolean-algebra operations and bounds are explicit arguments, matching the canonical seven-place upstream signature instead of assuming hidden components of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-poset-boolean-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"44ab18b3631aa4ec","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-poset-boolean-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-poset-boolean-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"44ab18b3631aa4ec","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBooleanAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^7$ (explicit Boolean-algebra predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-zfc-poset-boolean-algebra.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U,B,\\leq_B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBooleanUltrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^8","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBooleanAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}ultrafilter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBooleanUltrafilter}_S(U,B,\\leq_B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBooleanAlgebra}_S(B,\\leq_B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\n\\land U\\subseteq B\\land1_B\\in U\\land0_B\\notin U\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b\\in U\\;(a\\wedge_Bb\\in U)\n\\land\\forall a\\in U\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;(a\\wedge_Bb=a\\to b\\in U)\n\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;(b\\in U\\lor\\neg_Bb\\in U).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false}],"bytes":1413,"backlinks":[{"id":"746021e49bce8345","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBooleanUltraf